What is Object-oriented programming
   computer progamming model that organizes software design around data or objects (rather than functions or logic)
   objects needs to be manipulated rather than logic required to manipulate them
   great for large complex and actively updated or maintained programmes
   object-oriented program best for - collaborated development , projects devided into groups , code reusability , scalability and effeciency

